{"id":48471,"date":"2026-01-31T11:21:12","date_gmt":"2026-01-31T10:21:12","guid":{"rendered":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/?post_type=ajde_events&#038;p=48471"},"modified":"2026-09-03T01:35:26","modified_gmt":"2026-09-03T00:35:26","slug":"trail-do-queijo-da-fajazinha","status":"publish","type":"ajde_events","link":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/eventos\/trail-do-queijo-da-fajazinha\/","title":{"rendered":"Trail do Queijo da Faj\u00e3zinha 2026"},"content":{"rendered":"<style>.event_description, .eventcard, .evo_eventcard, .pr-page-wrapper { height: auto !important; max-height: none !important; overflow: visible !important; }<\/style>\n<p><!-- CARD 1: DESCRI\u00c7\u00c3O GERAL --><\/p>\n<div class=\"pr-content-card\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 20px; padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 24px;\">\n<h2 class=\"pr-card-title\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 16px;\">Sobre <span class=\"pr-gradient-text\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #C4B5FD 20%, #8B5CF6 100%); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\">Trail do Queijo da Faj\u00e3zinha 2026<\/span><\/h2>\n<p style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 16px;\">O <strong>V Trail do Queijo da Faj\u00e3zinha 2026 (TQF)<\/strong> \u00e9 uma das mais fascinantes e ex\u00f3ticas aventuras de trail running do arquip\u00e9lago dos <strong>A\u00e7ores<\/strong>, percorrendo fal\u00e9sias verdejantes, cascatas monumentais e trilhos vulc\u00e2nicos na paradis\u00edaca <strong>Ilha das Flores<\/strong>.<\/p>\n<p style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 0;\">Com centro nevr\u00e1lgico no <strong>Largo do Rossio<\/strong> na t\u00edpica freguesia da <strong>Faj\u00e3zinha<\/strong> (concelho de <strong>Lajes das Flores<\/strong>), o evento apresenta as dist\u00e2ncias de <strong>TQF42 (41 km com partida em Santa Cruz)<\/strong>, <strong>TQF21 (21 km)<\/strong>, <strong>TQF11 (11 km)<\/strong>, <strong>Caminhada (6 km)<\/strong> e <strong>Kids (1 km)<\/strong>. Promovido pelo <strong>Atl\u00e9tico Clube Faj\u00e3 Grande<\/strong> e pela Queijaria do Pico Redondo, os participantes desfrutam de degusta\u00e7\u00e3o do famoso Queijo da Faj\u00e3zinha, medalha artesanal a\u00e7oriana, t-shirt t\u00e9cnica e transporte oficial.<\/p>\n<\/div>\n<p><!-- CARD 2: FICHA T\u00c9CNICA \/ SNAPSHOT --><\/p>\n<div class=\"pr-content-card\" style=\"background: rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.06); border: 1px solid rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.25); border-radius: 20px; padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 24px;\">\n<h2 class=\"pr-card-title\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 20px;\">\u26a1 Ficha <span class=\"pr-gradient-text\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #C4B5FD 20%, #8B5CF6 100%); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\">T\u00e9cnica \/ Snapshot<\/span><\/h2>\n<ul class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-grid\" style=\"display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(240px, 1fr)); gap: 16px; width: 100%; box-sizing: border-box; list-style: none; padding: 0; margin: 0;\">\n<li class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-item\" style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 4px; width: 100%; min-width: 0; box-sizing: border-box; background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.02); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px;\"><strong class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-label\" style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 12px; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.5px;\">Data &#038; Hor\u00e1rio<\/strong><span class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-val\" style=\"color: #F8FAFC; font-size: 15px; font-weight: 600; word-break: break-word; overflow-wrap: anywhere; min-width: 0; display: block;\">10 de Outubro de 2026 \u00e0s 07:30<\/span><\/li>\n<li class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-item\" style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 4px; width: 100%; m